WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 c95948fc498cb52bc6b6826a80b63e6a

00:00:00.493 --> 00:00:02.092
Karibu kwenye uchambuzi mwingine wa kina.

00:00:03.532 --> 00:00:05.012
Natumaini umefurahia zoezi hili.

00:00:05.012 --> 00:00:07.852
Kama umelikamilisha,
nadhani inaridhisha sana kuona

00:00:07.932 --> 00:00:13.692
uhuishaji huu ukitokea. Kuna moja zuri sana,
mojawapo ya changamoto za kulipia,

00:00:13.692 --> 00:00:17.053
ambalo ni lile la ua linalochipua, ambalo ni

00:00:18.253 --> 00:00:20.972
mojawapo ya haya yenye changamoto zaidi, gumu zaidi,

00:00:22.092 --> 00:00:24.533
ambalo, sikumbuki kama
unalifungua hapa au la,

00:00:24.533 --> 00:00:27.213
lakini nakupendekezea kabisa.
Ni zoezi la kufurahisha sana, lakini

00:00:28.132 --> 00:00:30.213
linaweza kukatisha tamaa kidogo
kulipata sawasawa pia.

00:00:30.853 --> 00:00:36.853
Kwa hiyo mazoezi haya ni mifano mizuri ya
hali ambapo ukisoma maelekezo na kuyafuata

00:00:36.853 --> 00:00:37.813
hatua kwa hatua,

00:00:39.253 --> 00:00:42.893
sidhani ni magumu sana, lakini
usiposoma mambo kwa makini,

00:00:42.893 --> 00:00:44.292
yanaweza kuwa magumu kabisa.

00:00:45.173 --> 00:00:48.292
Kwa hiyo hilo ni jambo zuri
la kufikiria.

00:00:48.292 --> 00:00:52.173
Katika kupanga programu kwa ujumla, kwa kweli
unataka kuwa wazi kuhusu unachotaka

00:00:52.173 --> 00:00:54.453
kufanya kabla hujazama na kuanza kukifanya.

00:00:55.033 --> 00:00:59.033
Kadiri unavyokuwa wazi zaidi, na kuelewa
zaidi kabla ya kuanza kuandika msimbo,

00:00:59.273 --> 00:01:01.353
ndivyo kila kitu kitakavyokuwa rahisi zaidi.

00:01:02.073 --> 00:01:05.753
Kwa hiyo chukua dakika moja kusoma
maelekezo angalau mara moja,

00:01:05.753 --> 00:01:08.393
na uhakikishe yako wazi
kabla hujaanza kuandika.

00:01:08.873 --> 00:01:12.712
Kwa hiyo hapa tunachora mandhari hii ya
kitabu cha kugeuza kurasa unayoiona.

00:01:14.313 --> 00:01:15.912
Na tuna vitu vichache tofauti.

00:01:15.912 --> 00:01:19.433
Tunachora anga,
jua, bahari na mchanga.

00:01:19.972 --> 00:01:22.313
Na kwa kila kimoja, tunabadilisha
kitu fulani.

00:01:22.393 --> 00:01:26.722
Kwa hiyo tunalikuza jua. Linaanza na
5 na linakua kidogo kila mara.

00:01:27.683 --> 00:01:34.643
Na tunalisogeza jua, linashuka chini,
na tunabadilisha rangi ya jua.

00:01:35.043 --> 00:01:37.602
Kwa hiyo tunatumia rangi nyekundu, kijani na buluu.

00:01:38.082 --> 00:01:42.563
Na tunafanya. Tumependekeza hii, au nimependekeza
hii kama mahali pa kuanzia.

00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:47.602
Napendekeza upunguze kijani,
yaani ya pili, nyekundu, kijani, buluu, RGB,

00:01:48.102 --> 00:01:51.933
ili ionekane vizuri. Kisha
pia rangi ya anga.

00:01:51.933 --> 00:01:54.013
Napendekeza kutumia HSL,

00:01:55.373 --> 00:01:59.572
hue, saturation. Na je, nakumbuka,
ni luminosity au lightness?

00:01:59.572 --> 00:02:01.373
Nadhani ni lightness, ndiyo, lightness.

00:02:02.412 --> 00:02:04.412
HSL ili kuhuisha anga.

00:02:05.783 --> 00:02:10.413
Na tutafanya hivyo kwa kuongeza
hue katika uhuishaji wote.

00:02:12.413 --> 00:02:17.212
Kwa hiyo tunahuishaje kitu? Kimsingi,
tunafanya kitu kilekile mara

00:02:17.212 --> 00:02:20.973
nyingi. Kwa hiyo tunaanza na anga letu,
jua letu, bahari yetu na mchanga wetu.

00:02:21.443 --> 00:02:26.402
Kisha tutaendelea kuchora
mandhari mapya juu yake.

00:02:26.483 --> 00:02:28.763
Na kila mara tutavibadilisha
hivi kidogo.

00:02:28.763 --> 00:02:30.323
Kwa hiyo tuendeshe hii kwanza.

00:02:30.402 --> 00:02:33.122
Ni wazo zuri kila wakati. Kumbuka
kuendesha msimbo wa kuanzia.

00:02:33.592 --> 00:02:36.483
Nitaficha tu uhuishaji huu
kwa sababu unaudhi kidogo.

00:02:37.853 --> 00:02:40.562
Kwa hiyo unaona hii
inaanza ikionekana hivi.

00:02:41.573 --> 00:02:43.522
Jambo ambalo ni zuri.

00:02:44.323 --> 00:02:47.923
Kwa hiyo tunaona kwamba tunapaswa
kuanza na nusukipenyo cha tano hapa

00:02:48.282 --> 00:02:51.002
na kwamba tunapaswa kukikuza
kwa 0.2 kila marudio.

00:02:51.923 --> 00:02:53.802
Kwa hiyo hebu tuanze kwa kufanya hivyo

00:02:54.763 --> 00:03:00.842
na tuna marudio 100.
Kwa hiyo hebu tufanye repeat

00:03:01.883 --> 00:03:02.923
mara 100

00:03:04.763 --> 00:03:05.163
na

00:03:07.802 --> 00:03:11.883
tutasema tuna nusukipenyo
cha tano kinachohitaji kubadilika.

00:03:12.203 --> 00:03:15.082
Kwa hiyo tunabadilishaje kitu?
Tunaendeleaje kubadilisha namba?

00:03:15.242 --> 00:03:17.163
Tu, tunatumia variable, tunatumia sanduku.

00:03:17.402 --> 00:03:21.002
Kwa hiyo hebu tuliite hili sunRadius

00:03:22.923 --> 00:03:24.603
na tunaweza kuondoa maoni haya.

00:03:24.763 --> 00:03:30.763
Kwa hiyo sunRadius. Na sunRadius
inaanza na 5, na tunaweza tu kubadilisha hii.

00:03:30.923 --> 00:03:33.242
Ni wazo zuri kila wakati
kuendesha msimbo wako tena.

00:03:33.323 --> 00:03:36.842
Hakikisha tu, endesha msimbo wako. Unachora
kitu kilekile mara 100,

00:03:37.242 --> 00:03:42.203
kila kitu kama tulivyotarajia. Na
tunataka kulikuza kwa 0.2 kila mara.

00:03:43.082 --> 00:03:46.203
Kwa hiyo hebu tuchore. Anga,
jua, bahari na mchanga.

00:03:46.362 --> 00:03:48.842
Kisha hebu tuweke masasisho
yetu yote mwishoni.

00:03:48.923 --> 00:03:51.562
Kwa hiyo sasa tuna hii sunRadius,
na tutasema

00:03:51.562 --> 00:03:54.763
kwamba kila mara tunataka kuikuza kwa 0.2.

00:03:54.923 --> 00:03:58.362
Kwa hiyo hilo sasa linamaanisha kwamba
jua letu linakua mahali palepale

00:03:59.962 --> 00:04:01.723
hivyo. Safi sana.

00:04:03.082 --> 00:04:05.163
Kitu kinachofuata ni mahali jua lilipo.

00:04:05.242 --> 00:04:07.242
Kwa hiyo linaanzia 50, 10,

00:04:08.193 --> 00:04:13.233
kwa hiyo unaona 50, 10. Na tunapaswa
kulishusha angani kwa moja kila mara

00:04:13.233 --> 00:04:17.862
kwa hiyo hii 50 haihitaji
kubadilika, lakini sunY

00:04:19.632 --> 00:04:22.112
inapaswa kubadilika kuanzia 10.

00:04:23.312 --> 00:04:26.112
Kwa hiyo hebu tuhakikishe tunaunda
sanduku jipya kwa hili kwa kutumia let.

00:04:26.992 --> 00:04:29.072
Na hebu tuongeze hii chini kabisa.

00:04:29.072 --> 00:04:34.153
Kwa hiyo sunY ni sunY jumlisha. Linashuka
kila mara, kwa hiyo linazidi kuja chini.

00:04:34.153 --> 00:04:35.153
Kwa hiyo tutaongeza moja.

00:04:36.262 --> 00:04:40.983
Kwa hiyo sasa tukiendesha hii, tunapaswa kuona
jua likiwa kubwa zaidi na likishuka,

00:04:41.622 --> 00:04:42.742
jambo linaloonekana zuri sana.

00:04:43.622 --> 00:04:45.783
Kinachofuata ni rangi ya jua.

00:04:45.862 --> 00:04:51.942
Kwa hiyo tayari tuna variable kwa hili,
ambayo ni hii hapa, ambayo ni RGB.

00:04:51.942 --> 00:04:54.543
Na nimeweka thamani hii ya kuanzia, na

00:04:54.543 --> 00:04:58.423
ninapendekeza kwamba kila mara
tupunguze kijani hiki kwa moja.

00:04:59.463 --> 00:04:59.862
Kwa hiyo

00:05:01.072 --> 00:05:02.713
tunafanyaje hili? Njia bora ni ipi?

00:05:02.713 --> 00:05:08.673
Hatuwezi tu kufanya kitu kilekile kama
sunColor ni sawa na sunColor kutoa moja

00:05:08.992 --> 00:05:10.833
kwa sababu sunColor si namba.

00:05:11.872 --> 00:05:15.233
Kwa hiyo tunahitaji kutenga
sehemu hii moja tu.

00:05:15.233 --> 00:05:19.473
Kwa hiyo tuna nyekundu, kijani, buluu. Na
kijani hiki ndicho tunachotaka kutenga.

00:05:19.473 --> 00:05:23.872
Kwa hiyo hebu tuseme let sunGreen ni sawa na 237.

00:05:26.692 --> 00:05:29.492
Kisha tunachoweza kufanya ni,
badala ya kutumia sunColor

00:05:31.252 --> 00:05:35.413
hapa, tunaweza kusema RGB pamoja na nyekundu,
kijani na buluu yetu,

00:05:37.012 --> 00:05:39.333
lakini tunaweza kubadilisha kijani kila mara.

00:05:42.132 --> 00:05:49.012
Kwa hiyo tunaweza kusema sunGreen ni sawa na,
hii, kutoa moja kila mara.

00:05:50.293 --> 00:05:51.733
Kwa hiyo fikiria kinachotokea hapa.

00:05:51.812 --> 00:05:53.733
Kwa hiyo kila tunapopita kwenye kitanzi hiki,

00:05:54.062 --> 00:05:57.714
daima tuna nyekundu ileile, na
daima tuna buluu ileile, 255

00:05:57.771 --> 00:06:01.343
na 0,
lakini tunabadilisha kijani kila mara.

00:06:03.343 --> 00:06:06.223
Sasa kwangu hii inaonekana imevurugika kidogo.

00:06:06.463 --> 00:06:10.382
Kwa hiyo kwa kweli nadhani ninachopenda
ni kuwa na variable tu hapa,

00:06:12.062 --> 00:06:12.783
ambayo ni

00:06:15.583 --> 00:06:16.622
sunColor

00:06:18.382 --> 00:06:19.103
na kuwa na

00:06:20.122 --> 00:06:23.963
a. Lo, samahani. Kuwa na sunRed

00:06:26.202 --> 00:06:31.642
ya, 255, sunGreen na sunBlue ya sifuri.

00:06:35.963 --> 00:06:38.442
Na kujipa sunColor halisi.

00:06:38.442 --> 00:06:41.242
Hebu tusogeze hizi kidogo,
tuziweke zote pamoja.

00:06:44.043 --> 00:06:47.322
Kisha kila mara tunasasisha,

00:06:50.442 --> 00:06:56.442
sunGreen hapa. Lakini hebu pia,
kabla tu ya kuchora, jua hapa,

00:06:58.122 --> 00:06:59.163
tusasishe hii tena.

00:07:01.083 --> 00:07:02.122
Kwa hiyo hebu tufanye hivi.

00:07:05.802 --> 00:07:07.802
Kwa hiyo nadhani hii ni nadhifu zaidi kidogo.

00:07:08.202 --> 00:07:11.002
Tungeweza pia, labda tufanye hivi tu.

00:07:11.002 --> 00:07:12.322
Si. Sijui. Wewe unafikiri nini?

00:07:13.043 --> 00:07:18.083
Swali kwako. Je, unapendelea kuwa na
sunColor kama variable, ambayo ni safi,

00:07:18.322 --> 00:07:21.523
au unapendelea kuandika nyekundu,
kijani, buluu hii moja kwa moja hapa?

00:07:22.403 --> 00:07:26.083
Zote mbili ni sawa, nadhani.
Hebu tutumie hii kwa mfano huu.

00:07:26.963 --> 00:07:31.523
Kwa hiyo tuna nyekundu, kijani, buluu pamoja na
sunRed, sunGreen na sunBlue yetu,

00:07:31.843 --> 00:07:35.682
Nyekundu, kijani na buluu. Na pekee
tunayoibadilisha hapa ni kijani.

00:07:35.843 --> 00:07:37.843
Tunaifanya hii iwe ndogo zaidi kila mara

00:07:39.103 --> 00:07:41.663
na unaona inazidi
kuwa nyekundu zaidi na zaidi.

00:07:43.023 --> 00:07:45.583
Kisha tunahitaji kufanya vivyo hivyo kwa HSL hii.

00:07:46.543 --> 00:07:48.543
Kwa hiyo ni wazo lilelile kabisa.

00:07:50.783 --> 00:07:51.983
Hebu tuilete chini hapa.

00:07:55.023 --> 00:08:03.822
Kwa hiyo tuna sunHue 210. Tuna
sunSaturation ya 70.

00:08:04.892 --> 00:08:07.052
Tuna. Si sue, ni sun.

00:08:07.452 --> 00:08:08.892
Na tuna sun,

00:08:10.173 --> 00:08:11.853
nilisema ilikuwa nini? Lightness.

00:08:12.492 --> 00:08:13.132
Lightness,

00:08:14.973 --> 00:08:16.333
sunLightness

00:08:17.452 --> 00:08:18.333
ya, 60.

00:08:21.612 --> 00:08:24.012
Kisha tunataka kuziandika hizi
moja kwa moja humu.

00:08:24.173 --> 00:08:27.612
Kwa hiyo tuna HSL ya sunHue,

00:08:29.132 --> 00:08:31.632
sunSaturation na sunLightness.

00:08:35.312 --> 00:08:39.393
Kwa hiyo bado inapaswa kufanya kazi. Lakini
hatubadilishi rangi ya anga.

00:08:39.472 --> 00:08:41.633
Kwa hiyo tunahitaji kubadilisha rangi ya anga.

00:08:42.352 --> 00:08:45.472
Kwa hiyo hii inapendekeza machweo ya waridi.

00:08:46.113 --> 00:08:48.673
Kwa hiyo nini kinatupa machweo ya waridi?

00:08:49.552 --> 00:08:50.033
Labda,

00:08:51.633 --> 00:08:54.753
kubadilisha hue, ndiyo, kuongeza hue.

00:08:55.712 --> 00:08:59.472
Kwa hiyo hebu tujaribu mambo machache. Kwa hiyo
hebu tuseme skyHue

00:08:59.832 --> 00:09:01.793
itakuwa skyHue jumlisha moja.

00:09:01.793 --> 00:09:03.513
Kwa hiyo tutaiongeza hii kila mara.

00:09:05.273 --> 00:09:05.673
Na

00:09:07.033 --> 00:09:09.913
nime. Nimeiita sun,
inapaswa kuwa sky.

00:09:09.913 --> 00:09:11.273
Hongera, kama uligundua hilo.

00:09:20.153 --> 00:09:23.753
Sawa, haya basi. Tunaishia
na waridi angavu sana.

00:09:27.043 --> 00:09:29.082
Kwa hiyo hivyo ndivyo ninavyofikiria
kuhusu zoezi hili.

00:09:29.082 --> 00:09:32.322
Na, uliona maswali niliyokuwa
nikijiuliza nilipokuwa nikilifanya?

00:09:32.482 --> 00:09:37.202
Yale yalikuwa maswali ya kweli. Nilikuwa
nikifikiri, je, napendelea kuwa na

00:09:38.003 --> 00:09:42.643
variable hapa, kama skyColor,
ambayo imewekwa kuwa hii,

00:09:42.722 --> 00:09:45.202
ili kujaribu kufanya mstari huu
usomeke kwa urahisi zaidi kidogo,

00:09:45.442 --> 00:09:48.883
au nadhani mstari huu unasomeka
vya kutosha kama ulivyo?

00:09:50.003 --> 00:09:52.923
Huo ni uamuzi wa kupima faida na hasara.
Kila mtu atakuwa na maoni tofauti kidogo.

00:09:52.923 --> 00:09:56.482
Unapofanya kazi katika kampuni halisi,
kwa kawaida kuna desturi,

00:09:56.482 --> 00:09:59.562
kwa kawaida kuna njia ya kawaida ambayo
wewe na timu yako mnafanya jambo.

00:10:00.283 --> 00:10:02.763
Wakati mwingine hata kuna
viwango unavyopaswa kufuata.

00:10:04.842 --> 00:10:07.562
Katika hali hii, katika mazoezi haya,
wewe ndiye unayechagua.

00:10:07.643 --> 00:10:10.922
Sehemu kubwa ya furaha ya kupanga programu
ni kufanya maamuzi haya,

00:10:10.922 --> 00:10:12.842
kuchagua kile unachoona ni kizuri.

00:10:13.643 --> 00:10:16.842
Lakini,
nadhani kimawazo hii inaonekana nzuri kabisa.

00:10:17.202 --> 00:10:22.602
Tuna thamani zetu zote. Tunachora
anga, tunachora jua, bahari na mchanga.

00:10:22.682 --> 00:10:24.602
Kisha tunasasisha kila kitu mwishoni.

00:10:25.283 --> 00:10:29.923
Tungeweza pia, kama tungetaka, kusogeza
vitu hivi juu zaidi hivi,

00:10:30.403 --> 00:10:32.163
na bado ingefanya kazi vilevile kabisa.

00:10:32.482 --> 00:10:36.643
Ilimradi tunatumia thamani kabla
hatujaisasisha, bado itafanya kazi.

00:10:38.003 --> 00:10:40.643
Je, unafikiri hii ni nzuri zaidi au si nzuri sana?

00:10:41.682 --> 00:10:44.643
Mimi binafsi napendelea njia hii.

00:10:46.883 --> 00:10:50.243
Kama hivi,
ambapo tunasasisha variable zetu zote.

00:10:54.602 --> 00:10:55.722
Tayari kwa marudio yanayofuata?

00:10:58.023 --> 00:11:02.842
Unaweza pia, ukitaka, kuhamisha
kizuizi hiki chote cha msimbo hadi mwanzoni

00:11:03.802 --> 00:11:07.562
na badala yake upunguze thamani hizi za kuanzia kwa,

00:11:09.003 --> 00:11:12.602
kiasi kilekile. Lakini katika hali
hii, kwangu inaonekana imevurugika zaidi.

00:11:12.682 --> 00:11:16.403
Hizi ni namba nzuri, rahisi. Itabidi
uanze kuwa na kitu kama sunRadius

00:11:16.403 --> 00:11:19.003
ya 4.8 mwanzoni ili ifanye kazi.

00:11:19.602 --> 00:11:21.082
Kwa hiyo sidhani hiyo ni nzuri hivyo hapa.

00:11:21.082 --> 00:11:26.602
Nadhani ni wazi zaidi,
kufanya masasisho haya yote mwishoni.

00:11:26.602 --> 00:11:30.802
Jambo moja la kufikiria, hata hivyo, ni
kwamba sasa tunasasisha masanduku yote

00:11:31.442 --> 00:11:33.363
mara moja zaidi kuliko tunavyohitaji.

00:11:34.163 --> 00:11:37.923
Kwa hiyo tukiendesha msimbo huu na
kusogeza hadi mwisho kabisa,

00:11:38.003 --> 00:11:41.442
tunatumia tu mistari hii minne ya mwisho
ambapo tunasasisha sanduku,

00:11:42.082 --> 00:11:45.523
lakini kisha programu yetu inaisha.
Hatutumii kamwe thamani hiyo,

00:11:45.682 --> 00:11:47.523
thamani hii ya mwisho tuliyoweka sandukuni.

00:11:47.523 --> 00:11:54.702
Hatutumii kamwe hii 310 kwenye skyHue
au hii 25 kwenye sunRadius,

00:11:54.702 --> 00:11:57.822
hazitumiki kamwe. Kwa hiyo
hii haina ufanisi sana.

00:11:57.822 --> 00:12:00.582
Tunaiomba kompyuta
ifanye mambo manne ya ziada

00:12:01.623 --> 00:12:02.743
bila sababu yoyote ya kweli,

00:12:04.102 --> 00:12:08.263
bila sababu kwa upande wa kompyuta. Lakini kuna
sababu ya kusomeka, kama nilivyosema,

00:12:08.342 --> 00:12:13.702
kwa sababu kwangu, kuwa na mahali pazuri pa kuanzia
kama 5, 10, namba nzuri rahisi,

00:12:13.942 --> 00:12:16.182
kunafanya programu hii
iwe rahisi zaidi kusoma.

00:12:17.413 --> 00:12:21.092
Na kuweka,
kusasisha variable nne, unajua,

00:12:21.332 --> 00:12:26.052
ni haraka mno kwa kompyuta yako,
siwezi hata kubofya kwa kasi hiyo.

00:12:26.932 --> 00:12:28.653
Kwa hiyo haijalishi sana
kwamba unafanya hivyo.

00:12:28.653 --> 00:12:32.692
Lakini unapofikiria programu
kubwa zaidi na tata zaidi,

00:12:33.173 --> 00:12:35.212
haya ni mambo ya aina hii
unayotaka kuyaangalia.

00:12:35.212 --> 00:12:39.413
Je, ninafanya hivi kwa ufanisi? Je,
ninahitaji kufanya masasisho haya?

00:12:39.413 --> 00:12:40.773
Je, nipange mambo upya

00:12:41.732 --> 00:12:42.373
ili

00:12:43.352 --> 00:12:46.993
niweze kuepuka kufanya hivi? Hii ndiyo aina ya
kupima faida na hasara unayopaswa kuchambua na

00:12:46.993 --> 00:12:47.592
kufikiria.

00:12:48.873 --> 00:12:51.513
Natumaini hiki kimekuwa kipindi chenye manufaa.

00:12:51.663 --> 00:12:55.633
Kama unavyoona, kwanza, kuna njia nyingi
tofauti za kufanya mambo, na

00:12:55.633 --> 00:12:57.913
wewe kuchunguza faida na hasara
ni sehemu kubwa ya thamani yake.

00:12:58.153 --> 00:13:01.592
Na pili,
mimi pia hukosea kuandika na hufanya makosa, na huandika

00:13:01.913 --> 00:13:06.072
sky kama sun, na hufanya makosa ya aina hii
na kuchanganyikiwa kwa muda mfupi.

00:13:06.552 --> 00:13:08.952
Huenda ukafanya kosa kama hilo
na huenda likakuchukua

00:13:09.373 --> 00:13:13.212
dakika moja au mbili zaidi kugundua kwa nini,
nini kimeharibika, nini kinaendelea,

00:13:13.212 --> 00:13:16.572
kwa nini msimbo wako haukufanya kazi. Hilo
ni sawa kabisa kama ndivyo ilivyo.

00:13:17.133 --> 00:13:20.013
Mimi nime,
nimefanya makosa kama hayo mara nyingi sana,

00:13:20.013 --> 00:13:24.893
pengine mamia ya maelfu ya mara, hivi kwamba
papo hapo najua nimekosea wapi.

00:13:25.131 --> 00:13:28.972
Lakini nilipokuwa, unajua, naanza zamani sana,
kama ningefanya kosa kama hilo,

00:13:28.972 --> 00:13:31.293
huenda ingenichukua saa nyingi
kugundua kilichokuwa kimeharibika.

00:13:31.613 --> 00:13:34.133
Kwa hiyo usivunjike moyo
ukifanya makosa, na

00:13:34.133 --> 00:13:36.572
usivunjike moyo kama
inakuchukua muda mrefu zaidi

00:13:36.572 --> 00:13:38.972
kugundua kwa nini unafanya
makosa hayo pia.

00:13:39.052 --> 00:13:40.653
Hiyo ni sehemu tu ya mchakato wa kujifunza.

00:13:41.192 --> 00:13:43.913
Daima huwaambia wanafunzi wangu,
kila unapofanya kosa,

00:13:43.913 --> 00:13:46.393
unajifanyia hisani
kwa sababu unajifunza.

00:13:46.712 --> 00:13:50.153
Kila unapopata kitu sawa mara ya kwanza,
hujifunzi chochote.

00:13:50.153 --> 00:13:51.913
Tayari unakijua. Hukiweki,

00:13:51.993 --> 00:13:53.592
unatumia tu kwa vitendo kitu unachokijua.

00:13:53.592 --> 00:13:55.873
Kwa kweli hujifunzi, kutokana nacho.

00:13:55.873 --> 00:13:59.113
Kwa hiyo makosa ni mazuri sana.
Makosa ni kama nguvu ya ajabu.

00:13:59.113 --> 00:14:01.072
Kadiri unavyofanya makosa mengi zaidi,

00:14:01.072 --> 00:14:03.832
ndivyo utakavyokuwa msanidi programu
bora zaidi kwa muda mrefu.

00:14:03.913 --> 00:14:06.952
Kwa hiyo mimi, daima nahimiza makosa
ilimradi hayatokani

00:14:07.602 --> 00:14:10.202
na wewe kutofikiri, ilimradi

00:14:10.202 --> 00:14:13.442
unafanya tu makosa ya kuandika
au makosa ya kimawazo.

00:14:13.442 --> 00:14:15.643
Hayo ni mambo mazuri sana.
Utajifunza kutokana nayo.

00:14:15.643 --> 00:14:18.482
Lakini ukigundua kwamba kila
wakati unafanya makosa tu,

00:14:18.562 --> 00:14:20.163
labda punguza kasi kidogo tu.

00:14:20.163 --> 00:14:23.842
Na wakati mwingine kupunguza kasi kunafanya
kila kitu kiende kwa urahisi zaidi kidogo.

00:14:24.082 --> 00:14:27.523
Asante kwa kutazama. Natarajia kukuona
katika uchambuzi mwingine wa kina hivi karibuni.

00:14:27.523 --> 00:14:28.243
Kwaheri kwa sasa.
